<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: Czech CNB-120 index falls 7.1 points to 894.8 pts.</title>
<headline>Czech CNB-120 index falls 7.1 points to 894.8 pts.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1997-03-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The CNB-120 index, a broad daily measure of Czech equities, fell 7.1 points on Monday to 894.8, the Czech National Bank (CNB) said.</p>
<p>Seven of the ten sectoral indices lost, with the energy index falling the most, down 18.1 points, or 1.69 percent, to 1,053.8 points.</p>
<p>-- Prague Newsroom, 420-2-2423-0003</p>
</text>
